Description:
 linuxmuster-base7 - linuxmuster.net configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.3.39-0) lmn73; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(cupsd.conf): cups problem version >= cups-2.4.7-1.2ubuntu7.9 (#189).
   * fix(cupsd.conf): require @System auth for /admin/conf (#190).
   * fix(linuxmuster-release-upgrade): use linuxmuster-distupgrade to upgrade linuxmuster packages (a89bba9).
   * fix(linuxmuster-release-upgrade): guard resolv.conf, apt tweak removal and linbo
     session stopping against re-runs (#191, dbf726f).
   * fix(linuxmuster-release-upgrade): skip the OS release upgrade step if already done,
     so a re-run after a later-failing step doesn't abort before reaching it (#191, 2421a03).
   * fix(linuxmuster-release-upgrade): don't overwrite an existing resolv.conf backup on
     a re-run (#191, 8fee984).
